This software does not bundle legal content. When run, it ingests data from third-party
sources whose licences are stored per row in the database (`source_licence`) and must be
respected by anyone redistributing derived data:

- Federal Register of Legislation (legislation.gov.au): Commonwealth legislation,
  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0), © Commonwealth of Australia.
- High Court of Australia (hcourt.gov.au): judgments, Crown copyright, reproduction permitted
  under the Court's terms.
- Open Australian Legal Corpus (huggingface.co/datasets/umarbutler/open-australian-legal-corpus):
  aggregation with per-document licence metadata; see the dataset card.

AustLII and Jade.io content is not used.
